# PM Copilot — what must never be committed

# Runtime data the cockpit writes into a workspace (tasks, PRDs, quality
# reports, audit log). It belongs to the project, not to this package.
.pm-copilot/

# Dependencies and local build caches
node_modules/
*.log
*.tmp

# Editors / OS cruft
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# NOTE: client.js IS generated by scripts/build-client.mjs, but it is committed
# on purpose: installing this bundle must never require a build step
# (see README §7 and SPEC.md).
